  "deviations": [
    "lib/api-client.ts: two irreducible `as` casts (ApiResult<unknown> -> ApiResult<RouteOutput<R>> in call()/query()) because RouteDef erases response types; runtime data is zod-validated first. RouteInput keys are all optional (params/query/body present only when the route defines them).",
    "vite.config.ts: root package.json has no `version` (T-00-01 file), so readRootVersion falls back to '0.0.0' instead of throwing (Brief says throw) - otherwise vite build can never pass; supervisor readVersion will hit the same gap.",
    "RendererProps gets an optional `rendererKey` (Brief lists blockId,itemKey only) so the single shared NotYetRenderer can show data-renderer-key/description; NotYetRenderer props = same shape.",
    "markdown.tsx: rehype-sanitize default schema extended with the `concept` href protocol (needed because urlTransform runs after sanitize); also `//host` protocol-relative URLs are neutralised.",
    "createAppRouter(ctx, history?) takes an optional memory history (superset of Brief signature) for UT-WEB-441/442.",
    "stores/layout.ts adds drawerOpen/toggleDrawer/closeDrawer (Mod+\\ below lg opens the context Drawer); stores export factory + default instance each.",
    "theme.ts additionally exports windowMedia/currentDocTheme/useDocTheme (react hook); watchSystemTheme always re-resolves a11y attrs (contrast/transparency/motion), colour theme only changes when pref=system.",
    "shell-deps.tsx also exports createQueueCountsSource (external store for attempt-queue counts); boot-gate.tsx exports createBootSignals; boot dedupes per attempt (StrictMode-safe).",
    "app.css is the exact 4 lines; fonts: d2coding/d2coding-subset.css (pulls ~4MB of woff/ttf into dist). Test support files live in apps/web/test/unit/{lib,routing}/support/ (fixtures, events, fake-event-source, harness)."
  ],
